# RA PRACTICAL 12: Estimation of Trend using Moving Average

data("AirPassengers")
AirPassengers
plot(AirPassengers)

ma12 = filter(AirPassengers, filter = rep(1/12, 12), sides = 2)
plot(AirPassengers)
lines(ma12)

# Interpretation:
# 12-month moving average provides a much smoother curve because it averages observations over a complete year.


# 3-month moving average
ma3 = filter(AirPassengers, filter = rep(1/3, 3), sides = 2)
plot(AirPassengers)
lines(ma3)

# Interpretation:
# 3-month moving average smooths some of the short-term fluctuations in passenger numbers; however, seasonal fluctuations are still visible.
